Steps to Create the Script

Open Scratch and select the Cat Sprite.

Click on the Code tab.

Click on Extensions (bottom left) and add the Text to Speech extension.

From Events, drag:

when green flag clicked

Add the Following Blocks in Order:

From Looks:

say "Welcome to the Jungle!" for 1 seconds

From Text to Speech:

speak "Welcome to the Jungle!"

From Control:

wait 2 seconds

From Looks:

say "Elephants are the largest land animals." for 1 seconds

From Text to Speech:

speak "Elephants are the largest land animals."

From Control:

wait 1 seconds

From Looks:

say "Monkeys love to swing on trees!" for 1 seconds

From Text to Speech:

speak "Monkeys love to swing on trees!"

From Control:

wait 1 seconds

From Looks:

say "Parrots can mimic human speech." for 1 seconds

From Text to Speech:

speak "Parrots can mimic human speech."

From Control:

wait 1 seconds

From Looks:

say "Lions are known as the kings of the jungle." for 1 seconds

From Text to Speech:

speak "Lions are known as the kings of the jungle."

From Looks:

say "Thank you!" for 1 seconds

From Text to Speech:

speak "Thank you!"

Final Step

Click the Green Flag to run the project.

The cat will speak each fact with pauses in between.
